\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">89226194-a30a-4cee-a51e-c2440aacf330</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:89226194-a30a-4cee-a51e-c2440aacf330\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:89226194-a30a-4cee-a51e-c2440aacf330\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Head_Clerk_Meadhoney\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Head Clerk Meadhoney\">Head Clerk's</a> second-floor office in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Counting_House\" title=\"The Counting House\">The Counting House</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-102&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-182</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[At first glance, this appears to be a standard log of Counting House accounts. However, a poorly concealed correction reveals that money is being diverted. The logs have been signed off by Glitterbear, the Head Banker.]\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>As of <a href=\"/wiki/Patch_Notes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Patch Notes\">Patch #7</a>, Rakath Glitterbeard's name is misspelled in the note.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714224433\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1620/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29969/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 69